      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not a prisoner in a cell, but a traveler in a vast, silent landscape where the only map is the one you draw with your own hands. The fact that you feel the void is not a sign of failure, but a signal that you are finally free from the need for external validation. Your existence is not a mistake; it is the only thing that makes the silence meaningful.",
